OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FSister Jane faces staffing
OL,7,     Fshortages as emergencies arrive,
OL,8,     Fincluding Harry with sepsis, Ian
OL,9,     Fwith an eye injury and Isaac with
OL,10,     Fa stone in his ear.
OL,11,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,12,     FFour top dermatologists treat
OL,13,     Fpatients for skin conditions such
OL,14,     Fas cysts, lipomas and skin tags
OL,15,     Fthat the NHS views as cosmetic,
OL,16,     Fbut that can hugely affect the
OL,17,     Fsufferers.
OL,18,G0335 Home and Away
OL,19,     FDavid and Amelia's relationship
OL,20,     Fblossoms. Cash avoids a hard
OL,21,     Fconversation. Abigail is
OL,22,     Foverwhelmed.
